# Copy to .env for `npm run dev` (wrangler also reads .dev.vars). Get a free key at
# https://www.sptrans.com.br/desenvolvedores/ (Meus Aplicativos).
SPTRANS_TOKEN=
# Optional: CARTO basemaps key (Positron, Voyager), free at https://carto.com/basemaps/apikey/
# Lock it to your domains (and localhost for development) in CARTO's dashboard.
CARTO_API_KEY=
